Subject: [PATCH] DefaultExceptionHandlerLib: print ESR/FAR/SP and halt (RELEASE-visible)

2026-11-04R4 y700-elden: RELEASE 构建把寄存器 dump 编掉，只剩 ConOut 打印且它二次异常，
导致「Recursive exception」无限重印。改为纯 SerialPortWrite 打 ELR/ESR/FAR/SP 后 CpuDeadLoop。

diff --git a/ArmPkg/Library/DefaultExceptionHandlerLib/AArch64/DefaultExceptionHandler.c b/ArmPkg/Library/DefaultExceptionHandlerLib/AArch64/DefaultExceptionHandler.c
index 5f9bcf7..c44ef11 100644
--- a/ArmPkg/Library/DefaultExceptionHandlerLib/AArch64/DefaultExceptionHandler.c
+++ b/ArmPkg/Library/DefaultExceptionHandlerLib/AArch64/DefaultExceptionHandler.c
@@ -206,6 +206,25 @@ DefaultExceptionHandler (
   CharCount = AsciiSPrint (Buffer, sizeof (Buffer), "\n\n%a Exception at 0x%016lx\n", gExceptionTypeString[ExceptionType], SystemContext.SystemContextAArch64->ELR);
   SerialPortWrite ((UINT8 *)Buffer, CharCount);
 
+  //
+  // 2026-11-04R4 y700-elden: RELEASE build compiles out the DEBUG() register/stack dump,
+  // leaving only ConOut->OutputString(UnicodeBuffer) which re-faults here => infinite
+  // 'Recursive exception' repeat and no register ever visible. Print ESR/FAR/SP directly
+  // with SerialPortWrite, then halt (no stack dump: SP may already be garbage).
+  //
+  CharCount = AsciiSPrint (
+                Buffer,
+                sizeof (Buffer),
+                "  ELR=0x%016lx ESR=0x%08lx FAR=0x%016lx SP=0x%016lx\n",
+                SystemContext.SystemContextAArch64->ELR,
+                SystemContext.SystemContextAArch64->ESR,
+                SystemContext.SystemContextAArch64->FAR,
+                SystemContext.SystemContextAArch64->SP
+                );
+  SerialPortWrite ((UINT8 *)Buffer, CharCount);
+
+  CpuDeadLoop ();
+
   // Prepare a unicode buffer for ConOut, if applicable, in case the buffer
   // gets reused.
   UnicodeSPrintAsciiFormat (UnicodeBuffer, MAX_PRINT_CHARS, Buffer);
